/-! # Issued column of the signed calendar

For every residue index the positive team starts at the actual boot of the
installed calendar's original verifier and located gate table. Its guarded
source assignments are the numbered summands of the same frozen seed. -/

namespace OAI
namespace Computability
namespace BorderVNP

namespace Diagonal

open Diagonal.ExternalSew Cover Packing Packing.DeckGrid Crossing Branch Epoch PackedHistoryCircuit
open PackedHistoryCircuit.Normalized SelectedSchedule EnrichedOuter TeamScales TeamContraction ProcessorSlots
open VPVNP ParseBatch ParseBatchVerifier Prewire VPVNP.ParseGrammar
open FieldProcessor RoutingISA RoutingISA.Evaluator RoutingISA.Transmission
open GeometryAdvice GeometryFrameEncoding RoutingISA.Pins VPVNP.BurstRAM RoutingISA.CompactMachine TeamSite
open DiagonalResidueRAM ResidueEntryInput ResidueRates ResiduePins
